data_CIF_CSP

    _dictionary.title             CIF_CSP
    _dictionary.class             Instance
    _dictionary.version           0.1
    _dictionary.date              2026-04-21
    _dictionary.uri               https://github.com/COMCIFS/Structure_Prediction_Dictionary
!    _dictionary.ddl_conformance   4.1.0  # ! https://www.iucr.org/__data/iucr/cifdic_html/3/DDL_DIC/index.html
!    _dictionary.namespace         CifCore 
    _description.text
;
    The CIF CSP dictionary provides data items for describing crystal structure prediction (CSP) methodologies and 
    their resulting energy landscapes. By providing a common framework, we facilitate the sharing, comparison, and 
    analysis of CSP results across different research groups and methods. This is a DRAFT version and data items in 
    this dictionary should not be used until final approval by COMCIFS.
;

    loop_
      _dictionary_author.id
      _dictionary_author.id_ORCID
      _dictionary_author.name
      _dictionary_author.email
      1   0000-0003-0936-2342   'Francia, Nicholas'  nfrancia@ccdc.cam.ac.uk
      2   0000-0003-4901-9936   'Bruno, Ian'         .
      3   0000-0002-4612-9163   'Sugden, Isaac'      .
      4   0000-0002-5097-8416   'Hunnisett, Lily'    .
      5   0000-0001-9011-3962   'Nyman, Jonas'       .

